po_id=3119517&response-content-disposition=attachment%3Bfilename%3DMiFO_LFO_FEIS_NOA_Published.3.pdf&response-content-type=application%2Fpdf reader = PdfReader(\"MiFO_LFO_FEIS_NOA_Published.3.pdf\") page = reader.pages[0] page.extract_text() ```  The issue was introduced with https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/969  ### Patches  The issue was fixed with https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/1828  ### Workarounds  It is recommended to upgrade to `pypdf>=3.9.0`. PyPDF2 users should migrate to pypdf.  If you cannot update your version of pypdf, you should modify `pypdf/generic/_data_structures.py`:  ``` OLD: while peek not in (b\"\\r\", b\"\\n\"): NEW: while peek not in (b\"\\r\", b\"\\n\", b\"\"): ```"}]}, {"name": "pypdfium2", "version": "5.15.2", "vulns": []}, {"name": "python-dateutil", "version": "2.9.0.post0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "python-dotenv", "version": "1.2.4", "vulns": []}, {"name": "python-multipart", "version": "0.0.34", "vulns": []}, {"name": "pyyaml", "version": "6.0.3", "vulns": []}, {"name": "referencing", "version": "0.37.0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "regex", "version": "2026.11.19", "vulns": []}, {"name": "requests", "version": "2.34.2", "vulns": []}, {"name": "rpds-py", "version": "2026.9.1", "vulns": []}, {"name": "s3transfer", "version": "0.19.3", "vulns": []}, {"name": "six", "version": "1.17.0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "sniffio", "version": "1.3.1", "vulns": []}, {"name": "sortedcontainers", "version": "2.4.0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "sse-starlette", "version": "3.7.0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "starlette", "version": "1.10.0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "tiktoken", "version": "0.14.0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "tokenizers", "version": "0.23.3", "vulns": []}, {"name": "tqdm", "version": "4.70.1", "vulns": []}, {"name": "truststore", "version": "0.10.5", "vulns": []}, {"name": "typing-extensions", "version": "4.16.0", "vulns": []}, {"name": "typing-inspection", "version": "0.4.5", "vulns": []}, {"name": "urllib3", "version": "2.8.0", "vulns": []}, {"nam